(   2. Part \(ii\): Reduction Formula for I_n = int sec^n x dx:) Tj
T*
(   - Write sec^n x = sec^\(n-2\) x * sec^2 x.) Tj
T*
(   - Integrate by parts: let u = sec^\(n-2\) x, dv = sec^2 x dx \(v = tan x\).) Tj
T*
(   du = \(n - 2\) * sec^\(n-3\) x * \(sec x * tan x\) dx = \(n - 2\) * sec^\(n-2\) x * tan x dx.) Tj
T*
(   I_n = sec^\(n-2\) x * tan x - \(n - 2\) * int sec^\(n-2\) x * tan^2 x dx.) Tj
T*
(   - Use tan^2 x = sec^2 x - 1:) Tj
T*
(   I_n = sec^\(n-2\) x * tan x - \(n - 2\) * [ I_n - I_{n-2} ]) Tj
T*
(   I_n + \(n - 2\)*I_n = sec^\(n-2\) x * tan x + \(n - 2\) * I_{n-2}) Tj
T*
(   \(n - 1\)*I_n = sec^\(n-2\) x * tan x + \(n - 2\) * I_{n-2}) Tj
T*
(   I_n = [ sec^\(n-2\) x * tan x ] / \(n - 1\) + [ \(n - 2\) / \(n - 1\) ] * I_{n-2}. \(Proved\).) Tj
T*
(   - Evaluate I_3 = int sec^3 x dx:) Tj
T*
(   Set n = 3:) Tj
T*
(   I_3 = [ sec x * tan x ] / 2 + \(1 / 2\) * I_1.) Tj
T*
(   Since I_1 = int sec x dx = ln|sec x + tan x|:) Tj
T*
(   I_3 = \(1/2\) * sec x * tan x + \(1/2\) * ln|sec x + tan x| + C.) Tj
T*
