(   - Factor 1: 2 * int_0^\(pi/2\) sin^\(2m - 1\) theta * cos^\(2n - 1\) theta dtheta = Beta\(m, n\)) Tj
T*
(   \(Trigonometric form\).) Tj
T*
(   - Factor 2: In 2 * int_0^infinity e^\(-r^2\) * r^\(2\(m+n\) - 1\) dr, substitute u = r^2 \(du = 2r) Tj
T*
(   dr\):) Tj
T*
