(   [Problem Statement]: Find the arc length of the catenary y = c * cosh\(x / c\) between x = -a and x = a.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Step 1: Differentiate y with respect to x:) Tj
T*
(   y = c * cosh\(x / c\)) Tj
T*
(   => dy / dx = c * sinh\(x / c\) * \(1 / c\) = sinh\(x / c\).) Tj
T*
