T*
(   1 + \(dy/dx\)^2 = 1 + sinh^2\(x / c\).) Tj
T*
(   Using the fundamental hyperbolic identity cosh^2\(u\) - sinh^2\(u\) = 1:) Tj
T*
(   1 + sinh^2\(x / c\) = cosh^2\(x / c\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 3: Square root for arc length element:) Tj
T*
(   ds = sqrt\(cosh^2\(x / c\)\) dx = cosh\(x / c\) dx \(since cosh\(u\) >= 1 > 0 for all real u\).) Tj
T*
(   Step 4: Integrate from x = -a to x = a:) Tj
T*
(   By symmetry of the even function cosh\(x / c\):) Tj
T*
(   s = int_{-a}^a cosh\(x / c\) dx = 2 * int_0^a cosh\(x / c\) dx.) Tj
T*
