T*
(   s = 2 * [ c * sinh\(x / c\) ]_0^a) Tj
T*
(   = 2c * [ sinh\(a / c\) - sinh\(0\) ]) Tj
T*
(   = 2c * sinh\(a / c\).) Tj
T*
(   Conclusion:) Tj
T*
(   The total arc length of the catenary is 2c * sinh\(a / c\).) Tj
