T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Mathematical Formulation:) Tj
T*
(   - Production rate of total product mass:) Tj
T*
(   dM_p / dt = q_p * X\(t\) * V\(t\).) Tj
