(   X\(t\) = X0 * e^\(mu * t\)) Tj
T*
(   V\(t\) = V0 + F * t.) Tj
T*
(   - Total product mass accumulated at time T:) Tj
T*
(   M_p\(T\) = int_0^T q_p * X0 * e^\(mu * t\) * \(V0 + F * t\) dt) Tj
T*
(   = q_p * X0 * [ V0 * int_0^T e^\(mu * t\) dt + F * int_0^T t * e^\(mu * t\) dt ].) Tj
T*
(   2. Evaluate Integral 1:) Tj
T*
(   I1 = int_0^T e^\(mu * t\) dt = [ \(1 / mu\) * e^\(mu * t\) ]_0^T = \(1 / mu\) * \(e^\(mu * T\) - 1\).) Tj
T*
(   3. Evaluate Integral 2 \(Integration by Parts\):) Tj
T*
(   I2 = int_0^T t * e^\(mu * t\) dt.) Tj
T*
(   Let u = t, dv = e^\(mu * t\) dt => du = dt, v = \(1 / mu\) * e^\(mu * t\).) Tj
T*
(   I2 = [ \(t / mu\) * e^\(mu * t\) ]_0^T - \(1 / mu\) * int_0^T e^\(mu * t\) dt) Tj
T*
(   = \(T / mu\) * e^\(mu * T\) - \(1 / mu^2\) * \(e^\(mu * T\) - 1\).) Tj
T*
(   4. Combine Terms:) Tj
T*
(   M_p\(T\) = q_p * X0 * [ \(V0 / mu\) * \(e^\(mu * T\) - 1\) + \(F * T / mu\) * e^\(mu * T\) - \(F / mu^2\) *) Tj
T*
(   \(e^\(mu * T\) - 1\) ]) Tj
T*
(   = \(q_p * X0 / mu\) * [ \(V0 - F / mu\) * \(e^\(mu * T\) - 1\) + F * T * e^\(mu * T\) ].) Tj
T*
(   5. Analytical Verification:) Tj
T*
(   When F = 0 \(constant volume batch reactor\):) Tj
T*
(   M_p\(T\) = \(q_p * X0 * V0 / mu\) * \(e^\(mu * T\) - 1\), which matches standard batch product) Tj
T*
(   accumulation.) Tj
