/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Thermal sterilization of bioprocess media follows first-order thermal death kinetics: dN/dt = -k\(T\) * N, where k\(T\) = k0 * e^\(-Ea / \(R * T\(t\)\)\). Derive the Del Factor nabla = ln\(N0 / Nt\) = int_0^t k\(T\) dt and compute nabla for a linear heating profile T\(t\) = T0 + alpha * t.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Derivation of Del Factor \(nabla\):) Tj
T*
(   - First-order microbial inactivation ODE:) Tj
T*
(   dN / dt = -k\(T\) * N.) Tj
T*
(   - Separate variables:) Tj
T*
(   dN / N = -k\(T\) dt.) Tj
T*
(   - Integrate from t = 0 \(initial spore count N0\) to t = t_final \(final spore count Nt\):) Tj
T*
(   int_{N0}^{Nt} \(1 / N\) dN = - int_0^t k\(T\) dt) Tj
T*
(   ln\(Nt\) - ln\(N0\) = - int_0^t k\(T\) dt) Tj
T*
(   ln\(N0 / Nt\) = int_0^t k\(T\) dt.) Tj
T*
(   - The dimensionless sterilizing criterion is defined as the Del Factor nabla:) Tj
T*
(   nabla = ln\(N0 / Nt\) = int_0^t k0 * exp\(-Ea / \(R * T\(t\)\)\) dt. \(Proved\).) Tj
T*
(   2. Evaluation for Linear Heating Profile T\(t\) = T0 + alpha * t:) Tj
T*
(   - Let T\(t\) = T0 + alpha * t => dt = dT / alpha.) Tj
T*
(   - Limits: when t = 0, T = T0; when t = t, T = T1 = T0 + alpha * t.) Tj
T*
(   - nabla = \(k0 / alpha\) * int_{T0}^{T1} exp\(-Ea / \(R * T\)\) dT.) Tj
T*
(   - Substitute u = Ea / \(R * T\) => T = Ea / \(R * u\) => dT = - \(Ea / R\) * \(1 / u^2\) du:) Tj
T*
(   nabla = \(k0 * Ea / \(alpha * R\)\) * int_{u1}^{u0} [ e^\(-u\) / u^2 ] du,) Tj
T*
(   where u0 = Ea / \(R * T0\) and u1 = Ea / \(R * T1\).) Tj
T*
(   - Integrate by parts:) Tj
T*
(   int [ e^\(-u\) / u^2 ] du = - e^\(-u\) / u - int [ e^\(-u\) / u ] du.) Tj
T*
(   - Using asymptotic expansion of exponential integral E2\(u\) ~ \(e^\(-u\) / u\) * \(1 - 1/u\):) Tj
T*
(   nabla ~ \(k0 * R / \(alpha * Ea\)\) * [ T1^2 * exp\(-Ea / \(R * T1\)\) - T0^2 * exp\(-Ea / \(R * T0\)\) ].) Tj
T*
(   3. Engineering Application:) Tj
T*
(   In industrial fermenter sterilization, targeting a 12-log reduction \(N0 = 10^12 spores, Nt = 1) Tj
T*
(   spore\) requires:) Tj
T*
(   nabla = ln\(10^12\) = 12 * 2.303 ~ 27.64.) Tj
